WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.534 --> 00:00:10.616
Vinnie and Edward ran down the streets of London.

2
00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:15.139
When they got to the Globe Theater, it was full of people.

3
00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:18.084
Edward paid and they went inside.

4
00:00:18.085 --> 00:00:22.874
"Wow!" said Vinnie, looking around.

5
00:00:22.875 --> 00:00:27.588
The stage rose above the ground about one meter.

6
00:00:27.589 --> 00:00:31.705
The seats formed a half circle around the stage.

7
00:00:31.706 --> 00:00:35.531
They were on three levels, three stories high.

8
00:00:35.532 --> 00:00:38.087
The theater had no roof.

9
00:00:38.088 --> 00:00:42.945
Many people were standing on the ground in front of the stage.

10
00:00:42.946 --> 00:00:46.285
"What's the show?" asked Vinnie.

11
00:00:46.286 --> 00:00:49.803
"Romeo and Juliet," said Edward.

12
00:00:49.804 --> 00:00:54.275
Mandy was sitting with Lady Katherine on the second level.

13
00:00:54.276 --> 00:01:00.449
The richer people sat there because the seats were more expensive.

14
00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:03.792
The poorer people didn't have seats.

15
00:01:03.793 --> 00:01:07.314
They just stood in front of the stage.

16
00:01:07.315 --> 00:01:11.698
Mandy looked down and saw a familiar face.

17
00:01:11.699 --> 00:01:14.809
"Vinnie!" she shouted.

18
00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:16.372
Vinnie heard her.

19
00:01:16.373 --> 00:01:18.739
He looked up.

20
00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:22.802
"Mandy!" he yelled, and waved.

21
00:01:22.803 --> 00:01:27.357
"Vinnie, I'll be right down!" cried Mandy.

22
00:01:27.358 --> 00:01:31.018
"Stop!" snapped Lady Katherine.

23
00:01:31.019 --> 00:01:36.147
"My servants do not shout like street people!"

24
00:01:36.148 --> 00:01:41.213
Mandy apologized. "That's my brother," she said.

25
00:01:41.214 --> 00:01:43.667
"I have to go to him."

26
00:01:43.668 --> 00:01:48.805
"You may not leave without my permission," said Lady Katherine.

27
00:01:48.806 --> 00:01:52.482
"But I have to," said Mandy.

28
00:01:52.483 --> 00:01:55.828
She got up and walked to the stairs.

29
00:01:55.829 --> 00:02:00.291
Vinnie ran to the steps, but a guard stopped him.

30
00:02:00.292 --> 00:02:03.804
"You can't go up there," the guard grunted.

31
00:02:03.805 --> 00:02:07.343
"That level is for lords and ladies!"

32
00:02:07.344 --> 00:02:11.447
"But my sister . . ." Vinnie said, pointing.

33
00:02:11.448 --> 00:02:14.135
"Go back!" shouted the guard.

34
00:02:14.136 --> 00:02:16.204
"You're probably a thief!"

35
00:02:16.205 --> 00:02:22.212
"Come, Vinnie," said Edward, "I know of a secret stairway backstage."

36
00:02:22.213 --> 00:02:25.143
He took Vinnie behind the stage.

37
00:02:25.144 --> 00:02:28.346
Actors were getting into their costumes.

38
00:02:28.347 --> 00:02:31.735
Vinnie noticed something very strange.

39
00:02:31.736 --> 00:02:36.153
"Is Juliet a man?" he asked Edward.

40
00:02:36.154 --> 00:02:41.144
Edward burst out laughing.

41
00:02:41.145 --> 00:02:43.756
"All the actors are men!

42
00:02:43.757 --> 00:02:46.751
Women are not allowed on stage!"

43
00:02:46.752 --> 00:02:50.469
Suddenly, the guard was right behind them.

44
00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.171
"You are a thief!"

45
00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:56.209
he yelled, shaking his fist angrily at Vinnie.

46
00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:59.092
"Trying to steal from the actors!"

47
00:02:59.093 --> 00:03:03.745
He grabbed Vinnie and threw him on the floor.

48
00:03:03.746 --> 00:03:07.586
Just then, Mandy ran backstage.

49
00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:11.895
She looked around and saw Vinnie lying on the floor.

50
00:03:11.896 --> 00:03:18.285
Vinnie jumped up and grabbed Mandy's hand. "Run, Mandy!"

51
00:03:18.286 --> 00:03:22.886
"I'll keep the guard busy!" Edward shouted behind them.

52
00:03:22.887 --> 00:03:29.138
Vinnie and Mandy ran through the crowd, out of the theater, and into the street.

53
00:03:29.139 --> 00:03:32.135
Suddenly, Mandy screamed.

54
00:03:32.136 --> 00:03:35.942
Two large carriages almost ran over them.

55
00:03:35.943 --> 00:03:38.882
The drivers shouted angrily.

56
00:03:38.883 --> 00:03:42.471
A tall man got down from one carriage.

57
00:03:42.472 --> 00:03:45.726
"Are you children crazy?" he said.

58
00:03:45.727 --> 00:03:47.939
"Watch where you're going!"

59
00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:51.026
"They were running from someone,"

60
00:03:51.027 --> 00:03:54.546
said a woman's voice from inside the carriage.

61
00:03:54.547 --> 00:03:59.141
The man held out his hand to the woman.

62
00:03:59.142 --> 00:04:03.073
She took his hand and stepped out of the carriage.

63
00:04:03.074 --> 00:04:06.164
She was dressed in a deep-purple gown.

64
00:04:06.165 --> 00:04:09.876
"Bow before your queen," the man said.

65
00:04:09.877 --> 00:04:15.467
Everyone on the street stopped and bowed to the woman.

66
00:04:15.468 --> 00:04:21.948
"Is that . . . ," Vinnie gulped, " . . .Queen Elizabeth?"

67
00:04:21.949 --> 00:04:25.415
"Search them," she ordered.

68
00:04:25.416 --> 00:04:29.153
Two guards began searching Vinnie and Mandy.

69
00:04:29.154 --> 00:04:33.362
One guard found the glowing photo.

70
00:04:33.363 --> 00:04:36.543
"Your Majesty!" he gasped.

71
00:04:36.544 --> 00:04:41.069
With shaking hands, he handed the picture to the queen.

72
00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:42.615
She looked at it.

73
00:04:42.616 --> 00:04:45.134
Then she looked at the children.

74
00:04:45.135 --> 00:04:50.400
"Magic is not allowed in my kingdom," she said calmly.

75
00:04:50.401 --> 00:04:58.456
"Take them to the tower."
